<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Examen Completo de Inglés - Nivel B1/B2</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2c3e50;
      --secondary: #3498db;
      --accent: #e74c3c;
      --success: #27ae60;
      --warning: #f39c12;
      --bg: #f4f6f9;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --text: #333333;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      padding: 30px;
      position: relative;
    }

    header {
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #eef2f5;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .level-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e8f4f8;
      color: var(--secondary);
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* Security Notice */
    .security-notice {
      background-color: #fdf3d8;
      border-left: 5px solid var(--warning);
      padding: 12px 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #7d5a29;
    }

    /* Progress & Session Tabs */
    .session-indicator {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      gap: 5px;
    }

    .session-tab {
      flex: 1;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 10px 5px;
      background: #eef2f5;
      color: #7f8c8d;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: bold;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .session-tab.active {
      background: var(--secondary);
      color: white;
    }

    .session-tab.completed {
      background: var(--success);
      color: white;
    }

    .progress-bar-container {
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      background: #eef2f5;
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .progress-bar {
      height: 100%;
      width: 20%;
      background: var(--secondary);
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    /* Form Content */
    .session-block {
      display: none;
    }

    .session-block.active {
      display: block;
    }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
    }

    .question {
      background: #fdfdfd;
      border: 1px solid #eef2f5;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .question p {
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #2c3e50;
    }

    .options label {
      display: block;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .options label:hover {
      background: #edf2f7;
    }

    .options input[type="radio"] {
      margin-right: 10px;
    }

    input[type="text"], input[type="password"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background-color: white;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .match-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    @media (min-width: 600px) {
      .match-row {
        flex-direction: row;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
      }
      .match-row span {
        width: 55%;
      }
      .match-row select {
        width: 40%;
      }
    }

    /* Buttons */
    .nav-buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-top: 30px;
      gap: 15px;
    }

    button {
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-prev {
      background-color: #95a5a6;
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-prev:hover {
      background-color: #7f8c8d;
    }

    .btn-next {
      background-color: var(--secondary);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-next:hover {
      background-color: #2980b9;
    }

    .btn-submit {
      background-color: var(--success);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-submit:hover {
      background-color: #219150;
    }

    /* Results */
    #results {
      display: none;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .score-display {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }

    /* Lock Overlay Screen */
    #lockOverlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      background-color: rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.98);
      z-index: 9999;
      color: white;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    #lockOverlay h2 {
      font-size: 36px;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    #lockOverlay p {
      font-size: 16px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .teacher-box {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 380px;
    }

    .teacher-box input {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    #unlockBtn {
      background-color: var(--accent);
      color: white;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    #unlockBtn:hover {
      background-color: #c0392b;
    }

    .error-msg {
      color: #ff6b6b;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Screen Lock Overlay -->
  <div id="lockOverlay">
    <h2>⚠️ Examen Bloqueado</h2>
    <p>Has salido de la ventana o cambiado de pestaña durante la sesión de prueba. Por motivos de seguridad anti-fraude, la sesión ha sido suspendida.</p>
    <p><strong>Intentos de salida detectados: <span id="violationCount">0</span></strong></p>
    
    <div class="teacher-box">
      <p style="font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px;">Llama a tu docente para desbloquear el examen:</p>
      <input type="password" id="teacherCodeInput" placeholder="Código de acceso docente">
      <button id="unlockBtn" onclick="resumeExam()">Desbloquear Examen</button>
      <div id="errorMsg" class="error-msg">Código incorrecto. Solicita asistencia al docente.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>Examen General de Inglés</h1>
      <span class="level-badge">Nivel B1 / B2 (Intermedio Avanzado)</span>
