      <!-- SESIÓN 4 -->
      <div class="session-block" id="session-4">
        <h2 class="section-title">Sesión 4: Análisis de Lectura y Secuencia Lógica</h2>
        <div style="background: #eef2f5; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-style: italic; font-size: 14.5px;">
          "The rapid shift toward remote work has transformed corporate culture worldwide. While employees appreciate the flexibility, managers often struggle to maintain team cohesion and monitor productivity without micromanaging."
        </div>

        <div class="question">
          <p>16. According to the excerpt above, what is a main challenge for managers in remote settings?</p>
