            <label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="A"> A) Providing flexible work schedules.</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="B"> B) Maintaining team cohesion without micromanaging.</label>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q16" value="C"> C) Reducing overall corporate expenditures.</label>
