      <!-- SESIÓN 5 -->
      <div class="session-block" id="session-5">
        <h2 class="section-title">Sesión 5: Voz Pasiva, Discurso Indirecto y Conectores Avanzados</h2>

        <div class="question">
          <p>21. Passive Voice: "The engineers are currently testing the new software update." → The new software update _____ by the engineers.</p>
          <div class="options">
